orname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{10 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{10} x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{10}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676843 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0438bd23-6c13-56c2-affd-2ac3c282ca73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676707} {:answer/id #uuid "5be60abd-8380-5e16-bb21-8ca5440497c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}}{8}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676766} {:answer/id #uuid "856d11d6-0d10-53f1-84fb-098362206b3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676789} {:answer/id #uuid "a01bd723-2e88-5b18-b635-5b6f088926d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676804} {:answer/id #uuid "ec2c399f-c1a2-59ab-a76c-a167e2ae9f09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}}{64}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676859}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "856d11d6-0d10-53f1-84fb-098362206b3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676789} :answer-field/id #uuid "06b95b7d-9317-5427-b34d-9ac5f182aac0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676708}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d91f82e1-a5f1-59df-8ebb-04c941947778" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{x^{2} + 64}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 64=64(1+(\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{8},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{8}{x^{2} + 64}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}(8)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676844 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "23fb85f4-ddbe-5cc9-ab0d-60e54e5923a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676729} {:answer/id #uuid "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676737} {:answer/id #uuid "518b04bb-d23e-57d4-a2ea-d6457c3396e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}}{36}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676759} {:answer/id #uuid "672ddfcb-f2e1-587d-8100-bcc793f9051c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\fra