ctor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n7 x^{2} + 36=36(1+(\\frac{7}{36})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{6},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{6 \\sqrt{7}}{7})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{5}{7 x^{2} + 36}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{36}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{6})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{36}(\\frac{6 \\sqrt{7}}{7})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{7}}{42}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{42}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\right)}}{42}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676860 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10370922-a81e-5c1d-90ed-592688a39e00" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676717} {:answer/id #uuid "2c282b7e-5b06-5e40-b967-3f76ee982529" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676735} {:answer/id #uuid "48de8ff9-8f2a-51fc-9817-bd73df8d0c95" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676755} {:answer/id #uuid "c50902df-30da-580b-9820-7cbc7b16912a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676830} {:answer/id #uuid "dd006627-a0f0-52de-9ea1-8fc081e7df81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.t