})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679960 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2098c3eb-7c54-5dd1-85e5-8accd1cb5227" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679913} {:answer/id #uuid "2907bc60-6e8a-56b5-857d-03327fa2c2e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679919} {:answer/id #uuid "56fd3fae-8f97-53c2-a77f-fd0ee915e481" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{10} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679945} {:answer/id #uuid "72abfe11-1ac4-594b-bfca-5781f2d86621" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679965} {:answer/id #uuid "bde6f376-c854-5b67-93e8-19d710f17e43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186680001}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2907bc60-6e8a-56b5-857d-03327fa2c2e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679919} :answer-field/id